  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - National Utilities Regulatory Commission Solar-Plus-Storage Microgrids, through Rocky Mountain Institute</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant provides funding to support a technical assistance for the National Utilities Regulatory Commission in Saint Lucia to develop six distributed solar-plus-storage microgrids for critical facilities on the island. Project implementation would provide commercial opportunities for U.S. companies to export goods and services related to solar photovoltaic and battery energy storage solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
